      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Greenfield hosts the Yankee Siege, the world’s most powerful trebuchet, which has tossed pumpkins over 1,800 feet since 2004.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
